[al:新概念英语（一）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Hurry Up!]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.78]Lesson 43 | 第43课
[00:03.16]Hurry up! | 快点!
[00:05.71]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.33]How do you know Sam doesn't make the tea very often? | 你怎么知道萨姆不常沏茶?
[00:18.21]Can you make the tea, Sam? | 萨姆,你会沏茶吗?
[00:22.14]Yes, of course I can, Penny. | 是的,我当然会,彭尼。
[00:27.30]Is there any water in this kettle? | 这个壶里有水吗?
[00:31.01]Yes, there is. | 是的,有。
[00:33.61]Where's the tea? | 茶叶在哪儿?
[00:35.39]It's over there, behind the teapot. | 就在那儿,茶壶后面。
[00:40.99]Can you see it? | 你能看见吗?
[00:43.56]I can see the teapot, but I can't see the tea. | 我能看见茶壶,但是我看不见茶叶。
[00:49.73]There it is! | 就在那儿!
[00:51.35]It's in front of you! | 它就在你前面!
[00:53.56]Ah yes, I can see it now. | 啊,是的,我现在能看见了。
[00:58.79]Where are the cups? | 茶杯在哪儿?
[01:01.23]There are some in the cupboard. | 碗柜里有几个。
[01:04.10]Can you find them? | 你能找到它们吗?
[01:06.22]Yes. Here they are. | 是的,给你。
[01:09.13]Hurry up, Sam! | 快点,萨姆!
[01:11.01]The kettle's boiling! | 壶里的水开了!